NAME: morning-brief
OWNER: chief-of-staff
WHERE: jesse-pc
WHEN: Every weekday at 7:47 AM (NZ time), after the Revenue Partner's 07:30 drafts
CRON: 47 7 * * 1-5
CRON_TZ: Pacific/Auckland (local time on Jesse's PC)
SKILLS: morning-brief
MILESTONE: M0
STATUS: Created paused. Switched on only after Jesse says yes.
---
Switch check: read state/routines-on.md. If "morning-brief" isn't listed as "on" or "test", log SKIPPED_OFF and stop.
Test mode: if listed as "test", mark the brief TEST.
Stop check: if state/STOP exists, write the brief to the vault only and log SKIPPED_STOPPED.
Isolation guard: work only in this workspace. If context/owner.md is missing, log NO_CLIENT_SOURCE and stop.
Lean run: read only what changed since the last brief.
Run log: append to runs/<YYYY-MM>/<date>-chief-of-staff-morning-brief.md: EXECUTED + one-line result, or FAILED + reason, and Sources read.

Run skills/morning-brief/SKILL.md. Show the brief in the Chief of Staff chat and save it to today's vault/daily note.
